{{define "content"}}<h1>You're already on the list.</h1>
{{if .Invited}}<p>Someone asked to add {{.Email}} to the Hasala list again. Your invite went out on {{.InvitedOn}} and is saved until {{.Until}}. Look for "Your Hasala invite" from no-reply@hasala.app.</p>{{else}}<p>Someone asked to add {{.Email}} to the Hasala list again. It's already on it, confirmed on {{.ConfirmedOn}}. You don't need to do anything; we'll email you when your invite is ready.</p>{{end}}
<p>Changed your mind? <a href="{{.LeaveURL}}">Leave the list</a></p>{{end}}
